<title>NEW ZEALAND: Mr Chips declares 2.5 cps 2nd interim div.</title>
<headline>Mr Chips declares 2.5 cps 2nd interim div.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mr Chips on Monday announced a fully-imputed second interim dividend of 2.5 NZ cents per share, payable on March 14.</p>
<p>A supplementary dividend of 0.44 cps was also declared.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
